    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="7" relname="span">Good observation P33.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="8" relname="span">I think you brought up a good point about website design.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="11" relname="span">I wasn't aware of certain principles dealing with designing a good website either,</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="3" relname="circumstance">until I took this course and started reading the book.</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="10" relname="span">Now I'm designing my website over again with many of the ideas that I'm picking up here.</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="5" relname="evaluation">I guess that's one of the benefits of taking this class.</segment>
        <group id="7" type="span"/>
        <group id="8" type="span" parent="1" relname="elaboration"/>
